e task; KR: create test file (`.rick/jobs/job_31/doing/tests/task1.py`, already produced by the pi testgen invocation); success = test green + doing_check pass.\n\n**Step 2 (Context):** No `doing/debug/` records exist; no known issues.\n\n**Step 3 (Sub Agent workflow):** ANALYZE done. Test is already green (this is a self-referential e2e verification: target file == test script). Now the COMMIT phase — commit artifacts, mark task success with commit hash, then run doing_check. Let me check prior commit patterns first:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_TWEXqHfajvEUEjD1Y8df1318","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && git show --stat 171440f 2>/dev/null | head -30; echo \"===JOB31 FILES===\"; find .rick/jobs/job_31 -type f | sort"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":3913,"output":1204,"cacheRead":19584,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":866,"totalTokens":24701,"cost":{"input":0.0005478200000000001,"output":0.00033712,"cacheRead":0.0000548352,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0009397752000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786455676819,"responseId":"f6476060-5ecb-4cd5-9e5e-b690676d5e13","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_TWEXqHfajvEUEjD1Y8df1318","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"commit 171440f01e7bb1083e1997f92d4c06d79a9f54a7\nAuthor: logic <logic.math.code@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sun Jul 5 01:15:36 2026 +0800\n\n    chore(job26/task1): mark task1 as success\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .rick/jobs/job_26/doing/tasks.json | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 50 insertions(+)\n===JOB31 FILES===\n.rick/jobs/job_31/doing/prompts/skill_debug_skill.md\n.rick/jobs/job_31/doing/prompts/skill_tdd_zh.md\n.rick/jobs/job_31/doing/prompts/skill_testing_anti_patterns_zh.md\n.rick/jobs/job_31/doing/prompts/task1_doing_prompt.md\n.rick/jobs/job_31/